--- !u!114 &350203133
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 350203132}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You understand what just left this ship. Those visors don't record to a
      chip. They stream. The whole fight, your face, all of it, went up the chain
      before the last of them hit the deck.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 170fe2806a18dc94da1d7c0c7e7fd0de, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: To the voice. The one that wasn't the squad's.
    seconds: 3.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2632dcb2d74909c4780165c12e6948b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You caught that.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed701f6d47dddc5429b6107e2d183c35, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: The others obeyed it without thinking. That's not a commander. That's an
      owner.
    seconds: 5.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 268db9d082258a2478b80d171b7f6f01, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: 'Yeah. Whoever built you sold the use of you a long time ago. That voice
      holds the lease. And whatever doubt it had: is he really standing, is the file
      wrong. You just answered it. In full color.'
    seconds: 15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 692959e53f5df3f479a23b125a3a77ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You said the debt made you open the casket. A man doesn't crack a Dominion
      seal to repay a kindness. Not unless he needs the kindness to be worth something.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 905aae91a83d5864a9074504b5dbc284, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I needed to believe a thing like you could exist. A killer that stops.
      Because if one could, then maybe the galaxy still owes mercy to a man who can't
      buy it any other way.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8cd4e11e548db7d45ae7338f43a7036b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: What man.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c41f844ae2027194c940b19347d07018, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1122054132}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1172065566}
  audioSource: {fileID: 350203134}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
